WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:01.513
This is Vibeke.

00:00:01.513 --> 00:00:06.970
It keeps your coding agents running, and lets you reach them from any screen.

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:10.113
Vibeke runs in your terminal.

00:00:10.113 --> 00:00:15.412
Each project gets a workspace, and each agent runs in its own pane.

00:00:15.412 --> 00:00:17.706
Here, Claude is fixing a bug.

00:00:17.706 --> 00:00:21.740
You see every agent, on every machine, in one list.

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:26.393
When an agent needs a decision, it shows up in your inbox.

00:00:26.393 --> 00:00:29.869
Approve it with one key, and the agent keeps working.

00:00:32.223 --> 00:00:35.446
This agent runs on a second machine, the devbox.

00:00:35.446 --> 00:00:41.223
It starts a web server, and Vibeke opens the page in a browser pane next to the agent.

00:00:50.511 --> 00:00:54.231
Screenshots from the agent pop up right in your terminal.

00:00:58.179 --> 00:01:01.859
You can also open the page in the browser on your laptop.

00:01:02.709 --> 00:01:04.239
Need a faster machine?

00:01:04.239 --> 00:01:06.604
Hand the work to another computer.

00:01:06.604 --> 00:01:10.917
Vibeke sends the branch, your changes and the agent's session.

00:01:10.917 --> 00:01:15.509
Accept it on the devbox, and the agent continues where it stopped.

00:01:21.331 --> 00:01:23.993
The desktop app shows the same session.

00:01:23.993 --> 00:01:29.931
Read what each agent did, review the changes, and look at screenshots before you merge.

00:01:31.705 --> 00:01:35.203
On a Mac, Vibeke also sits in the menu bar.

00:01:35.203 --> 00:01:38.945
One click shows every agent and every request.

00:01:39.795 --> 00:01:44.065
To add your phone, scan the code in your terminal and confirm it.

00:01:44.065 --> 00:01:49.847
The connection is end-to-end encrypted, so the relay in the middle never sees your code.

00:01:49.847 --> 00:01:55.235
Now you can approve requests and give your agents new instructions, from anywhere.

00:02:09.887 --> 00:02:11.569
Want a second pair of eyes?

00:02:11.569 --> 00:02:13.438
Share a pane with a colleague.

00:02:13.438 --> 00:02:17.487
They open the link in a browser and follow the agent as it works.

00:02:34.398 --> 00:02:37.357
Install Vibeke with one command.

00:02:37.357 --> 00:02:40.038
Learn more at vibeke.dev.
